  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c764a2788d68d9419e0781f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，让我听到胜利欢呼吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fd7f240952f309facf1a314c12665bbd740bcce2e9c7bd0baa91f8fbcde69f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:088df386f1bee3664155540b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夹到了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea0398d811775b77005a0b9a45eb5b8f463daf2e227b94c5a7388bef1d7ddc46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43503a6424b50bd1ada0f89d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0ed975f157e7c977ff9f4521907358dc8405b43368d86c1f2e0bda3b6004bc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed1b67f6be1ca1f050236887",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "传颂吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c577350b085d0cac44c3b1e0ef314e8f4532cc3d7b26e438c5eb7edfaf2e3e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b636393401f74b490e7bfc55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做得很好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "236e525eaf465869104480728930d1a18ea575a313bfddfa361a15b518a23e56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f575f1e835331a41e818360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被黑暗吞噬了啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa912f0f1708efb7de88f615ba7e199a9836a3f243b353b08a814f04045fe81f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:028eedc839ec67ff515ad44a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "传颂吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c577350b085d0cac44c3b1e0ef314e8f4532cc3d7b26e438c5eb7edfaf2e3e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2c2734329ff2b4b07565966",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做得很好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "236e525eaf465869104480728930d1a18ea575a313bfddfa361a15b518a23e56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9385adfca886b3d88ad7c8db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c261f8470e6b951068e0d77063c43fa4dad0595f35b1742681492d1a2f963251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:239fd69247823a952ccb1c9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈──哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b606fb34bf848de805742a125f2904cb099d9e31ad81a0ac3f8448c21c7c4fae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f29df0f765e958a3da7394e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e358f3890b1a24b9bcb6526889cfb39fb6444a5068f0fe4d0662096fd4a6d151",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d38392598b294bb4f7565f03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8a047e6d033874db4c41eea1841321bf4c7b84166b9be8490dc39921d6d502b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08ae5a3a3248df58f3a1c618",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fae634bd9fed421672fb72e9b24f793384cadde5c35454a04573eec752d6239",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fb0e757e7e920fff601956a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "491afe930290ca00537960230e3bbc3448d690ce63dc08b63e2557d06bba67b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c4d3158b1d0892f2c3109b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "533af1ec55aaabd2fb64979f1b375b53b2aa3d91c5132bfaaf1eceef39f399ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cc4e331611947147aafec6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21bed79927e5236d335292545e9ebd0f5f41ee49249a49856519a27ee9095c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5774d2258014a95e29cbfde0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5ff5cce81279530c135c050e17109de8add1ffa81928fb66087b20c046edd58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b27f661a9a9df3c30706eb45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4e1df408b325e7498dd0dbd16dfa65e96cd654a4bab6bba7b78f0a47f36a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:957416d4410c51a80728613e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "67d0eeceded72eace8823cc24b753a0a3007c8ea0e0a4fc8073e9cf559b5eb03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29908c47a2285c3ee21d5c4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天好像能拿到这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05455df9a61eff2f59cb5dc2bf0840682d0169c42988968da22137fe1da487b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eacb5032be4f43979188c29b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔喔，全知的神啊……！\r\n请赐吾一滴活力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ab257dee9693c33c243f22058ccafd4e770c3d787f328087f1110a823269d82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e11ceab7d719483acbd6f1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔？喔，是你啊。\r\n……我刚做了场白日梦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff5a10ea74d6d838a4d5868225bbe88d19b322ce3e39e02a7e0beaf0bce3553c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3c42a8d6c7e3dfcc839eab2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈──哈哈哈哈！\r\n破坏冲动直冲脑门！\r\n栅栏！栅栏！哪里有栅栏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f31329e8fa7e357bc221deaeb0e4f21bcf152554f61416168f3efb8a88e9734a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af513a457c7d252e19de8585",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧！\r\n若凭借着吾与你的恶梦──\r\n要颠覆世界也谓是轻而易举！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef0582ac566f263dbac9b68a1ca0fa7fd5b10f85b90f562f0e3075610a8e7503",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ae4463290eb5a7fa1fb9ca3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "西风向吾低语──\r\n要吾化作划破天空的风！\r\n上吧，开始训练了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42090eaaf3081f1643ac8041d5ceb0521fde1e1c2c4c0c47c6893fbeb838d36e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a7ea98682e5c3132066342f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练项目就交给你决定。\r\n尽管改写我的剧本吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea660077aec20bba5ce905898bc857c964a2df3f6effd37061ed735928feff94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efc6d25b72cf2304f3d249d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "亘古不变的日子也不赖。\r\n好了，今天要描绘点什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb341e09b276e752c6f8b88ca0d9e453954af9567803867c9682abd50dfe6840",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bc7ef2e1f752624c95dbc7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "风平浪静──没什么，\r\n只是这句话突然浮现在脑中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75ec663dfd0f9c63ae34a941e046d7921688c40ba4f1df927a8511b47814b0fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2896acf27fe8636530f7009f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……！深渊的安宁\r\n呼唤着吾……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e824fc278c8c1e389c306703d21b8b4b712a4e5ebc6962941b9e9a968fb58c8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:499b0076add02186c8822ed8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊……力量在……！\r\n咒术啊，难道你要吞噬我吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93f4bf8a29ba95f5ae80be26c9eba5d322de082cbe1d45519fe696632eb7c402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58b790b01af6c004b0efb3c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呵。\r\n……今天打烊了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0155de8c283c16dc3a6dd62ec2c1d737544fd51633456ae157485d5df3138d72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:115e9e96a7a1e7385e8bfeea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……好想喝爸爸调制的\r\n无酒精热鸡尾酒……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2414870a39ea4db9afdc0242ef3df80e007de0f323f48dc30857e424883b9cd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:639a04ac08df28ac25a389fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有天赋。\r\n但并非是半神半人──！\r\n别急着下决断，深思熟虑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1fb0f2651c3770a020fd6a5788bac0ceef7e6baeecaf087b0f07d5362a53d11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40a39e0a2ea0eb523e56694c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是愚蠢……醒醒吧！\r\n难道你迷失了自己的使命吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d785793b33a53af84245a7ed0617c6bdc25cc25f07d357d39421944685c9981c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75dbc6c9fc1f91e521ce6c33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈──哈哈哈！\r\n时机成熟了！\r\n来吧，出航前往理想乡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02a41e104226e60df452328e3b1f7e534543127e2212dabd6f5da4714b684774",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1040c254d2bba68acbe033aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的状态已达颠峰！\r\n有如身披灼热的炼狱火焰！让我在\r\n赛场上烙下永世无法抹灭的痕迹吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1176dafb3c7178b4d0867eb0e1e8278ecbe0b540a924b1a83e4320fbd69b207",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba0ee3ed02b8343f05c358e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵……！哈──哈哈哈！\r\n烙印在大脑、视网膜、记忆中吧！\r\n这就是吾的存在意义！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ec5a67e8871495b5b269665d1d813548a483f1cfe518d4372f95e72b5df050b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a4f911c045eb164fed673bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已完成了理想的调整。\r\n来，一起携手等待终焉吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2070a1e5ebeef8f584129db1a64be967175c7438408ddf3c5c5a380683de42b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:547c488a772db0e50b805f7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高举军旗吧！\r\n胜利机会就在单片羽翼的前方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0e9eca30d5d32240cb4753b7cde3bdcf4f43fe750f6db0e8c2fab2e54042a41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d72c06fa58db3a3f7d1d4c12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你听得到吗？\r\n我灵魂轻快又雀跃的声音！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0ff1b4d81334ea652b0ead3574ff08f395f092264597882a2450edc60b9fc3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc51fe071f917f4f21584f50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该完成的事情没有改变──\r\n秩序掌握在吾手中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd350572f2d8aeafc289b74f084e5d6f075329e55f5f311baddaedbce36b660d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fe20a759c51a534288cdbec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吾仅需驰骋在荒野中──\r\n而你仅需为吾的表现心动！",
      "source_fingerprint": "143ba9cb10a3f720dcd56ce1acc23160264a7d7891d571db13c0e51c18d60a48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:000b0f856aa8113d81af8d9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "考验、祈祷不会改变……！\r\n我要与万千火焰一同奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5622a49d392da0122290e9b42c628c2217ccc017e643bc2dab5d737b220b6dca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c703c8d73b1ad33ea1b7f049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔，今天左手始终隐隐作痛着，\r\n但……！呵呵！带有让步的比赛，\r\n对我来说刚刚好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9857230472ea700106b6d7682463cf7ffb2be95a43b5459139e8f799a205f0cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cbdf122e7880d735f15fc6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「调整不足」啊──哼！\r\n别担心！这只是枝微末节的小事！\r\n我的炼狱火焰不会就这样熄灭！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38c5101ae8388b6903605bde3f827ffa4801417889f71c469930065d4d7a1503",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92b2598dbb84750fb4fc7b51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有意思……第十三关考验啊──！\r\n我会将这一切化为我的功绩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61df9314f33bda77a43a932e19c5ba2bbe9bd93aea78ddc6b8649fe39342a3e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:172cd74dab9a13e6320bf5a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巴别塔──终将迎接崩毁的命运吗。\r\n不……！我不承认……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf14ef30314561acde38a13ffc83408299f0e1c6ed02dacbfda6029fbb1e63fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67c94fab480704af8b6c572a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔……\r\n听到了身体发出叹息声──",
      "source_fingerprint": "49b53c660be2e2cbdf93a7dc7207fcab75ea3f8cdadf0f31d2f6e3a176701752",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ffd678dcd7c008a254ee9ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呼──！\r\n……集中力在……可恶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ed68d22d50086ce1bbb0f1ff6902dd1cf37bb2398d8fe065bfe6973c090455",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:820ff15db5cc7b7b91fc7315",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3140b08545d3a073b2347a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd39c284289b19c8944436e7ca3b6b2ead589d70912da6f1ecd3665819f7367",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:597687923e78d5b38e4a6c42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是考验！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef512db6558976641413f1f22428247b14cd3a8ee61d28d6ef73ad0b447dc461",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33de6a2b7a2b0966ea585e20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是芦苇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cd308b9383d9f187064c7b12ff8b522f095eef9ff69ada0654c3a853692829a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:103af4a8095904c2bdca318b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4e1df408b325e7498dd0dbd16dfa65e96cd654a4bab6bba7b78f0a47f36a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89028b6bc024a6425e8b8d45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太遗憾了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d8a565badea463d7e46dd935fa389e0610161e938859c3aee45106a758a5e58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:860be973f664c53be2d13986",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的旅程啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f03b62c4b3101c592b0b52a460032a6de49a86f3213f8ec67d6446fd16de945",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e9d27144e64cff342758e2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回到母亲般的大海怀抱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51072b3bb6e6f30a8d0ab3903e361c74fa2e66000aa642b92249c3147b842e84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9764d58555d79fa9a0fe87b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "极品美酒完成了──\r\n容我向你致谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38f9d55addc7f52e6b4e3e5d4472f2daaff889bc25c05273f507d6f6cacf95d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf971a5672a3af76c7fab63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的罗盘从不失准。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb3e98ebb0a1e56354f0d5f046635c943337a7f4963ce80081ed8f6c715a3929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a966f8191405c1aa619beafb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "展现你的力量吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfda2dd3e24b38a0058782cc2ce72f056571a306dbe1bb08b96092fcf353c0dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b31fdfe5012ac734b78ae1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "战士啊，集合吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c3f13542f7a1cd20894fedea598b718dd0b3ffb4ddc88e33141061125067ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0956d1da3d739faf0de8852",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，咆哮吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b8aba0cfb21888f6f3a869c308619ba765b454152f3e74236c9a7d2dca26ebb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be9f9f4d1fe42ca5926c658",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的罗盘从不失准。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb3e98ebb0a1e56354f0d5f046635c943337a7f4963ce80081ed8f6c715a3929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4ab0122825e5fddb90de8b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你听得到吗？\r\n我灵魂兴奋的声音！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0758274137edd393b0515fa168e11f02c3b2733e6be997b7e7784498f5163db5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf1a06e084ba02425f353434",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵……！哈──哈哈哈！\r\n烙印在大脑、视网膜、记忆中吧！\r\n这就是吾的存在意义！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ec5a67e8871495b5b269665d1d813548a483f1cfe518d4372f95e72b5df050b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf6d4a3ea276f84c5178a857",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的罗盘从不失准。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb3e98ebb0a1e56354f0d5f046635c943337a7f4963ce80081ed8f6c715a3929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e796c303fa80ecca84c0da99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a91c3a42bee3b610a977d9d276cc865eacf6a6007436b210196e4495453836d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a62458f5cbf7b243224f63ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别担心，可能性还没消失！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0118ed55deb4c790e006ebe5cad8d96ecca1fd7ce431ecc4d269d4efc1c4b4a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ac09d3d0a492fa3c920e788",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乐园路迢迢啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6990e80a52e5a61868f79f081218d7a758b519afed8d92b300fc3068b752737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e26912d88ad1bdc42557bd16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……有很多该跨越的考验……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac347601a482b88e672742af514aeaa6b35ba373dad4fa5bcade02d1d595fbb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d15a1ea3ab19b0a6d247c9a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迷失在迷宫里了啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1febd3c081c72ac27599d20462e3b8196d1656bb6f53ca9fc02e31d6fce79c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:956a64bebbfc4615c8753fd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为吾沉醉吧！为我这胜利美酒沉醉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26d552eb6b578e154788aaae9d70232beb2e91ef0805e84345002c387b041146",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269810fc250cd6e3a565c2fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵！全新的创世纪诞生了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cdb166320b59a2168ddbe51d878133e3de4238354d2cbaf944c6b1499c4717f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c2b3d84459cace72871a2e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，深深刻划吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a88b122f5f15b6a1bc77b7b8cdf0e520cc7e6e488cf705ab2090c06b1043c817",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e2d46674a3b41b200918e06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带来破坏与酩酊吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a87c785477eae4abbd68a5aa317f1fde2e0e17e65ea8e62d9569393f4f75727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5326907e723c1c25aa0b935d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演劇…それは刹那の断片。\r\n演じることもまた、刹那の仮初だ。\r\n…ワタシが創るに相応しい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03ecc58179cc76a625d48e8dfa94a2a147bb4d81784e1f5b950d2dd924b42e3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:579eff98082c199d70722e57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そう…そうだ、それでいい！\r\n劇よ走れ、我が為の結末に\r\n向かって…突き進むのだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9a2f278d916a893bc065e41224c1dd2d43e2799699ae184d4ef6bf8885bf52f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9750650ee1a329612e1eaec0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて…業火よ、焼き尽くすがいい。\r\n台本は不要だ。別れを継ぎ接ぎ、\r\n次なる役を演じるために…さらば！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdb413f9470bbae71ef30e09256ee0f638c4b07dc8f0e137da8fc95a4a1f4fc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8432a1153fcb18b8904312bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吾手中是潘多拉之盒，禁忌果实──\r\n沉醉于破坏、禁忌，沉醉于吾吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "131426521ae4cc02b8ff403ef5b8b14d4f2b1034d21ac0fbe459a56a21f67099",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b33489fa5fec389cee1b66d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吾的天籁──连岩户都会为之敞开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd0200ba0001ae63fc919f7e5955f5cc8dedebe2e6b9cd9a7a9e26adc035e52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "60000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
